WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.991
The next day Tom practiced some spells.

2
00:00:14.992 --> 00:00:22.633
He tried to make stone bricks appear.

3
00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:42.525
Poof! Cheese bricks appeared!

4
00:00:42.526 --> 00:00:45.570
The knight arrived.

5
00:00:45.571 --> 00:00:56.768
Cat hid as the knight looked around.

6
00:00:56.769 --> 00:01:01.273
"Can you turn these bricks into gold?" the knight asked.

7
00:01:01.274 --> 00:01:05.843
"This knight is greedy," Tom thought.

8
00:01:05.844 --> 00:01:10.192
"You have one free spell," Tom said.

9
00:01:10.193 --> 00:01:13.411
"Do you want some gold bricks?"

10
00:01:13.412 --> 00:01:16.879
"Hmm," the knight said.

11
00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:31.834
He walked around the lab.

12
00:01:31.835 --> 00:01:36.950
Tom saw him steal some cheese.

13
00:01:36.951 --> 00:01:42.725
"I do not like this knight," Tom thought.

14
00:01:42.726 --> 00:01:46.880
"I want to win the joust," the knight said finally.

15
00:01:46.881 --> 00:01:50.101
"I want to win the prize money.

16
00:01:50.102 --> 00:01:55.200
But my horse doesn't obey me.

17
00:01:55.201 --> 00:02:01.884
Do a spell that will make her obey me."

18
00:02:01.885 --> 00:02:05.773
The joust was a contest at the Royal Fair.

19
00:02:05.774 --> 00:02:09.797
Knights held lances and rode horses.

20
00:02:09.798 --> 00:02:16.922
They tried to knock down other knights.

21
00:02:16.923 --> 00:02:22.535
The last knight on a horse won.

22
00:02:22.536 --> 00:02:26.079
Tom frowned. "That's cheating."

23
00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:30.360
"I won the magic spell," the knight snapped.

24
00:02:30.361 --> 00:02:33.316
"You must do it, Wizard!"

25
00:02:33.317 --> 00:02:36.318
Tom frowned again.

26
00:02:36.319 --> 00:02:40.211
The knight wore a nasty grin.

27
00:02:40.212 --> 00:02:45.388
"I could sell my card to Dirk," he said.

28
00:02:45.389 --> 00:02:50.826
"He is bald, but he won the free haircut card!"

29
00:02:50.827 --> 00:02:56.008
Tom sighed. "Fine.

30
00:02:56.009 --> 00:03:00.293
Meet me at the jousting field at midnight.

31
00:03:00.294 --> 00:03:07.400
Bring your horse."

